WEBVTT

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:31.433
what is the biggest prime that we know about?

00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:35.741
Today we're going to hunt for that massive prime.

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:38.888
Don't freak out.

00:04:38.888 --> 00:04:41.889
All you need to know, of all the mathematics

00:04:41.889 --> 00:04:46.374
you've ever learned, unlearned, crammed, forgotten,

00:04:46.374 --> 00:04:48.107
never understood in the first place,

00:04:48.107 --> 00:04:50.492
all you need to know is this:

00:04:50.492 --> 00:04:54.739
When I say 2 ^ 5,

00:04:54.739 --> 00:04:57.586
I'm talking about five little number twos next to each other

00:04:57.586 --> 00:04:58.881
all multiplied together,

00:04:58.881 --> 00:05:02.097
2 x 2 x 2 x 2 x 2.